OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers arrested after derelict
OL,4,Ahotel fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson following a fire at
OL,8,Fa derelict hotel on the Isle of Wight.
OL,10,FHampshire and Isle of Wight Fire and
OL,11,FRescue Service said it received a call
OL,12,Fat about 03:30 BST on Sunday reporting
OL,13,Fa blaze at the hotel on Sandown High
OL,14,FStreet.
OL,16,FIt said crews from Shanklin, Ryde,
OL,17,FVentnor, Newport and Freshwater were
OL,18,Fsent to the scene and confirmed nobody
OL,19,Fwas injured, or evacuated from the
OL,20,Fbuilding.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
