OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers arrested after derelict
OL,4,Ahotel fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire police has now arrested two
OL,7,F17-year-old boys from Ventnor. They
OL,8,Fhave been bailed until 11 January while
OL,9,Finvestigations continue.
